{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/2025/0801/c58897a3072581/pagem.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:35.725489+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/2025/0801/c58897a3072581/pagem.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>欢迎外校和本校外院（系）优秀学子申请浙江大学药学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年推免研究生！相关说明通知如下：</span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>招收类型：</span></p><p><span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>类型</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>方向<span>/</span>研究所名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>拟招推免生类型</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>学术学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>100700</span></p></td><td><p><span>药学</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>按药学一级学科<span>/</span>领域招生</span></p><p><span>涵盖<span>6</span>个研究所和安评中心</span></p></td><td><p><span>直接攻博<span>/</span>学硕</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>105500</span></p></td><td><p><span>药学</span></p></td><td><p><span>直接攻博<span>/</span>专硕</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>086002</span></p></td><td><p><span>制药工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>台州研究院新药创制工程项目</span></p></td><td><p><span>专硕</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>备注：其中制药工程专业学位学籍为工程师学院。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>符合条件的申请者须在浙江大学研究生招生服务系统（</span><span><a href=\"https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</span></a></span><span>）注册、登录后提交报名申请（申请时间：</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日</span><span>10</span><span>时</span><span>-9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>24</span><span>时），将有效身份证扫描件、本科期间成绩单、外语水平证明、科研成果证明、获奖证明等材料合成</span><span>1</span><span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件上传系统。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>申请条件、报名方式和流程等详见“浙江大学关于</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知” </span><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28498a3071793/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28498a3071793/page.htm</span></span></span></a><span><span>；如申请本科直博，应具有较高水平的英语能力，原则上大学英语六级</span><span>460</span><span>及以上或</span><span>WSK</span><span>（</span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）合格或英语专业八级合格或英语国家获得过学士及以上学位，成绩有效期五年（指考试时间在</span><span>2021</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月及以后）；或雅思</span><span>5.5</span><span>及以上或托福</span><span>80</span><span>及以上（不认可家考成绩），有效期参照证书的有效期；同时还须提供至少两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家（或相当专<span>业职称的专家）的</span></span><span>书面推荐意见</span>（<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/4f2633a725899a136aad.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/59/9b/648c719f43d9a5f1a7553a2985dc/687ea45b-544a-4acb-a343-57a0d4cd3c91.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件.docx</a>）<span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>复试名单、复试办法等请关注学院官网、推免系统等后续通知；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>导师信息见附件；</span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>咨询方式：邮箱：</span><span><span>0571-88208159 </span><a href=\"mailto:hzczywj@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>hzczywj@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></span><span> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/59/9b/648c719f43d9a5f1a7553a2985dc/1ba4165a-fedc-493c-ab96-1585437b1c47.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件1：药学院研究生导师信息参考.xlsx</span></a></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/59/9b/648c719f43d9a5f1a7553a2985dc/d5d805df-86a8-4b2a-a8e5-588e33204e9d.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件2：新药创制工程卓越培养项目导师信息.xlsx</span></a></span></p><p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span>   </span></p><p><span> </span><span>药学院</span></p><p><span>  </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span>    </span><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"652c5ea7d73b69a4513bfa8eb28462c907956505f65d633a56fb678d8e6b36b2","textLength":800,"sourceSha256":"14fd64b57c09ee2a2b26eb11e3e7b4119d1a16028222b0a3e0bf50125003d27a","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-01697dc2c2727fde2d96","title":"2025年浙江大学药学院关于2026年接收外校、本校外院（系）推荐免试研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:35.725489+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/4f2633a725899a136aad.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif"}]}
